  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "'## [11.0.0](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v10.5.0...v11.0.0) (2026-05-19)\n\n### ⚠ BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* **kubernetes-client:** The `LabelSelectors` namespace is renamed to `Selectors`.\nTo migrate, rename the namespaces.\n* **kubernetes-client:** The `DefaultEntityLabelSelector` class is now sealed instead\nof public. To mitigate, use the implementation with the interface\n(intended way) instead of subclassing the default selector.\n\n### Features\n\n* Add `ToIdentifierString` overloads ([#1120](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1120)) ([ff0180e](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/ff0180e43566e6fd8442c5f06d6adbe56d76a19b))\n* **kubernetes-client:** add field selector support ([#1094](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1094)) ([c16228f](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/c16228faf7a20485d8d672fdff1de7c3a613684b))\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **test:** update dependency coverlet.collector to 10.0.1 ([#1123](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1123)) ([d18f0e1](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/d18f0e1426ccea07c1df3c7b88c2e9e74b0745fd))\n* **test:** update dependency fluentassertions to 8.10.0 ([#1117](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1117)) ([6901432](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/6901432fa7ccfcbb4e6870c2d6802ae49e32beab))\n* **test:** update dotnet monorepo ([#1116](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1116)) ([f30e8e7](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/f30e8e7dc25156cca1d0ba0ac305180e8bdbc7be))\n'",
